Package: shinobi-installer
Version: 0.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Shinobi OS Maintainers <maintainers@shinobi-os.local>
Depends: shinobi-core (= 0.1.0), calamares (>= 3.4.0)
Recommends: shinobi-desktop (= 0.1.0)
Description: The Shinobi Installation Wizard
 The graphical installer for Shinobi OS, built on Calamares and branded as the
 Shinobi Installation Wizard.
 .
 It installs the system booted from the live image onto a disk: the same
 packages, the same configuration and the same fonts that the live session has
 been running, rather than a second list assembled at install time. An installer
 that resolves dependencies from a repository at the moment somebody chooses a
 disk is a different system from the one that was tested, and it fails on the
 wifi.
 .
 The wizard is offline by design. Nothing it does reaches the network, because
 the archive it came from is on the medium and the layer it applies is already
 installed.
